37             Using this program:
38         
39               * See USER PROCESSING AND SETTINGS, below, to configure this program for your environment and data
40               * Program will plot all visits, ordered by AVISITN, with maximum of 20 boxes on a page (default)
41                 + see user option MAX_BOXES_PER_PAGE, below, to change limit of 20 boxes per page
42               * Program separately plots all parameters provided in PARAMCD
43               * Measurements within each PARAMCD and ATPTN determine precision of statistical results
44                 + MEAN gets 1 extra decimal, STD DEV gets 2 extra decimals
45                 + see macro UTIL_VALUE_FORMAT to modify this behavior
46               * If your treatment names are too long for the summary table, abbreviate them
47                 in the input data, and add a footnote that explains your short Tx codes
48                 + This program contains custom code to shorted Tx labels in the PhUSE CS test data
49                 + See "2b) USER SUBSET of data", below
